config BR2_PACKAGE_RECAMERA_FIRMWARE
	bool "recamera-firmware (Wi-Fi, Bluetooth and HaLow firmware)"
	help
	  The firmware the reCamera radios load, downloaded from their
	  public sources at pinned commits (sha256 checked):
	  - CYW43012 Wi-Fi (brcmfmac43012-sdio .bin/.clm_blob/.txt) and
	    Bluetooth (.hcd) from the Seeed reCamera trees;
	  - Morse Micro MM6108 HaLow firmware and the Quectel FGH100M
	    board configuration from MorseMicro/morse-firmware.
